{"id":"n83465-1-8","stage":2,"title":"습하다 · 潮湿","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83465-1-8-1","ko":"찌개랑 국이 같이 끓으니까 정말 습하다!","zh":"汤和炖菜一起煮，真是湿气太重了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"찌개랑","meaning":"浓汤，汤，锅","explanation":"찌개：浓汤，汤，锅；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"찌개","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26901","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌개랑","audio":"/audio/b3e8d14af39a583c230d.mp3"}},{"text":"국이","meaning":"汤水，汤汁","explanation":"국：汤水，汤汁；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"국","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36778","senseId":"2","lemma":"국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국이","audio":"/audio/24fc2becef7a044e10e1.mp3"}},{"text":"같이","meaning":"一同，一块儿，共同","explanation":"같이：一同，一块儿，共同。","readings":[{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26799","senseId":"2","lemma":"같이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같이","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3"}},{"text":"끓으니까","meaning":"沸腾，开","explanation":"끓다：沸腾，开；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"끓다","audio":"/audio/9cc2edb7c58868d6db66.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62282","senseId":"1","lemma":"끓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끓으니까","audio":"/audio/69487c8b36365667aa8e.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"습하다!","meaning":"潮湿","explanation":"습하다：潮湿；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"습하다","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83465","senseId":"1","lemma":"습하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"습하다","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ab54be0a69403de0","term":"찌개","zh":"浓汤，汤，锅","audio":"/audio/ab54be0a69403de061db.mp3","entryId":"26901","definition":"一种微咸的菜肴，在容器中放入少量汤汁后放入肉、豆腐或蔬菜等食材，再放入适量的辣椒酱或大酱等作料和酱油煮制而成。","pronunciation":["찌개"]},{"id":"8178f6b3db96ee30","term":"국","zh":"汤水，汤汁","audio":"/audio/8178f6b3db96ee306d49.mp3","entryId":"36778","definition":"在汤或炖菜汤等的饭菜里，除去汤料剩下的水。","pronunciation":["국"]},{"id":"d44da011993f2a6e","term":"같이","zh":"一同，一块儿，共同","audio":"/audio/d44da011993f2a6e9ba5.mp3","entryId":"26799","definition":"和某物或某人一起。","pronunciation":["가치"]},{"id":"9cc2edb7c58868d6","term":"끓다","zh":"沸腾，开","audio":"/audio/9cc2edb7c58868d6db66.mp3","entryId":"62282","definition":"液体滚烫，冒出气泡。","pronunciation":["끌타"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f9c6b95f334f5796","term":"습하다","zh":"潮湿","audio":"/audio/f9c6b95f334f5796df04.mp3","entryId":"83465","definition":"不干燥，水汽重，湿润。","pronunciation":["스파다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8bc4748b8bb876ed2e2d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83465-1-8-2","ko":"꼭 사우나 같아. 창문 좀 열자.","zh":"简直像桑拿房一样。把窗户打开吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"꼭","meaning":"仿佛，好像","explanation":"꼭：仿佛，好像。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"3","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"사우나","meaning":"桑拿","explanation":"사우나：桑拿。","readings":[{"term":"사우나","audio":"/audio/da69ba98156a5974e4de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61644","senseId":"2","lemma":"사우나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사우나","audio":"/audio/da69ba98156a5974e4de.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问